 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Text translation
+
+The home page and `/devtools-times/translate` include a text translator supporting
+16 languages and up to 500 characters per translation. Select the source and target
+languages, enter text, and choose **Translate text** (or press Ctrl/Cmd + Enter).
+Translations can be copied or read aloud when the browser supports speech synthesis.
+
+`POST /devtools-times/api/translate` accepts JSON with `text`, `source`, and `target`.
+It validates input and forwards text to the [MyMemory API](https://mymemory.translated.net/doc/spec.php),
+splitting requests to respect the provider's 500-byte UTF-8 limit. No API key is required.
+The free service has a shared daily quota; service failures and quota limits are shown
+in the UI. Text is sent to MyMemory for processing. Read-aloud voices depend on the browser.
